@c -*-texinfo-*-
@node gpui-design Manual
@chapter Crate @code{gpui-design}
@cindex gpui-design
@cindex design system

@code{gpui-design} is a platform-adaptive design system. It defines
shape, spacing, interaction and animation rules that vary per
platform; @code{gpui-themes} handles colours independently. The two
layers compose: any colour theme works with any design system.

@menu
* gpui-design User Guide::
* gpui-design Developer Guide::
@end menu

@node gpui-design User Guide
@section User Guide

End users do not configure this directly. The effect is visible:

@itemize @bullet
@item On macOS: continuous corners, 44 px touch targets, spring
  animations (Apple HIG).
@item On Windows: compact spacing, pill toggles, Segoe UI Variable
  (Fluent).
@item On Android-ish: 48 px touch targets, card separators, Roboto
  (Material 3).
@item Elsewhere: the @code{Neutral} fallback.
@end itemize

@node gpui-design Developer Guide
@section Developer Guide

@subheading Presets

@multitable @columnfractions .30 .25 .45
@headitem Preset @tab Platform @tab Key traits
@item @code{DesignSystem::neutral()} @tab Cross-platform default @tab
  matches existing hardcoded values
@item @code{DesignSystem::apple_hig()} @tab macOS / iOS @tab continuous
  corners, 44 px targets, spring anim.
@item @code{DesignSystem::material3()} @tab Android / ChromeOS @tab
  48 px targets, card separators, Roboto
@item @code{DesignSystem::fluent()} @tab Windows 10/11 @tab compact,
  pill toggles, Segoe UI Variable
@item @code{DesignSystem::platform_default()} @tab Auto @tab selects
  via @code{target_os}
@end multitable

@subheading Usage

@example
let ds = DesignSystem::platform_default();
let padding = ds.spacing.card_padding;
let gap     = ds.spacing.control_gap;
let radius  = ds.corners.md;
@end example

@subheading What lives where

@itemize @bullet
@item Spacing tokens: padding, gap, inset.
@item Corner tokens: radii per size class.
@item Interaction tokens: touch-target minimums, hover/pressed scale.
@item Animation tokens: durations, easing curves.
@end itemize

Colours @strong{never} live here. Use @ref{gpui-themes Manual}.
